  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Clinton Health Initiative - Pilot demand-driven Impact Evaluations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the pilot is to test whether the findings from impact evaluations that are generated by national Ministry of Health officials and that address operational questions in a timely manner are more likely to be accepted and implemented than from traditional impact evaluations</narrative>
